<title>USA: Utica CS, Mich., won by First Of America.</title>
<headline>Utica CS, Mich., won by First Of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Of America Sec., Inc., said it won $9.995 million of Utica CS, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.7052 percent.</p>
</text>
